{"4027540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Singularity", "steam_appid": 4027540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious mind-bending Virtual Reality puzzle-adventure game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've been recruited to help guide an evolving AI to think like a human.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must solve intricate puzzles and collect data fragments as you navigate digital dreams, where memories and predictions blur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the boundaries between realities dissolve, deeper truths begin to surface, leading you to question the true nature of your role, and who or what can you really trust?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious mind-bending Virtual Reality puzzle-adventure game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've been recruited to help guide an evolving AI to think like a human.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must solve intricate puzzles and collect data fragments as you navigate digital dreams, where memories and predictions blur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the boundaries between realities dissolve, deeper truths begin to surface, leading you to question the true nature of your role, and who or what can you really trust?</p>", "short_description": "A sci-fi VR puzzle-adventure game, where you are recruited to guide an evolving AI superintelligence. Solve intricate challenges within a labyrinth of simulated worlds as you uncover dark truths, leading you to question, who and what can you really trust?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027540/68d01ea9fe6f668c2ce220bc7c653388f9ecbc33/header.jpg?t=1758538961", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027540/bc793d818d5f921110ee6efa941c2a5eec2b8960/capsule_231x87.